  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "\304\220\303\242y l\303\240 b\341\272\243n t\303\263m t\341\272\257t ti\341\272\277n \304\221\341\273\231 c\303\264ng vi\341\273\207c cho \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng \"Smart Auto Clicker\".\n\n### 1. Outstanding User Requests\n*   **Implement UI (Jetpack Compose):** X\303\242y d\341\273\261ng giao di\341\273\207n ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng ch\303\255nh, h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 Material 3 v\303\240 Dark Mode. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n*   **Implement Overlay (SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW):** X\303\242y d\341\273\261ng c\341\273\255a s\341\273\225 n\341\273\225i cho ph\303\251p ch\341\273\215n \304\221i\341\273\203m/v\303\271ng v\303\240 \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n Start/Stop. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n*   **Implement Script Engine (Rhino):** T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p engine JavaScript \304\221\341\273\203 th\341\273\261c thi c\303\241c script m\341\272\253u v\303\240 script ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng t\341\273\261 vi\341\272\277t. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n*   **Implement OCR Logic (ML Kit):** X\341\273\255 l\303\275 \341\272\243nh t\341\273\253 `ScreenCaptureService` \304\221\341\273\203 nh\341\272\255n di\341\273\207n v\304\203n b\341\272\243n. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n*   **Implement Macro/Script Execution Logic:** X\303\242y d\341\273\261ng tr\303\254nh qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 th\341\273\261c thi chu\341\273\227i h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng (Macro) v\303\240 script. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n*   **Implement Remaining Services:** Ho\303\240n thi\341\273\207n `OverlayService` v\303\240 `SmartClickerTileService`. (Status: NOT STARTED)\n\n### 2. User Knowledge\n*   **Y\303\252u c\341\272\247u k\341\273\271 thu\341\272\255t:** \341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng kh\303\264ng root, minSdk 26, targetSdk 34, Kotlin, Jetpack Compose (Material 3).\n*   **C\303\264ng ngh\341\273\207 c\341\273\221t l\303\265i:** AccessibilityService (click/gesture), MediaProjection (ch\341\273\245p m\303\240n h\303\254nh), Google ML Kit (OCR), Rhino (Script engine), Room (l\306\260u tr\341\273\257).\n*   **Quy\341\273\201n:** C\341\272\247n h\306\260\341\273\233ng d\341\272\253n ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng c\341\272\245p quy\341\273\201n Accessibility, Overlay, MediaProjection, th\303\264ng b\303\241o.\n*   **H\341\272\241n ch\341\272\277:** M\303\240n h\303\254nh c\303\263 `FLAG_SECURE` kh\303\264ng th\341\273\203 ch\341\273\245p \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c.\n\n### 3. Work Accomplished\n*   **Project Setup:** C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh `build.gradle.kts`, `libs.versions.toml`, `AndroidManifest.xml` v\341\273\233i \304\221\341\272\247y \304\221\341\273\247 quy\341\273\201n v\303\240 service c\341\272\247n thi\341\272\277t.\n*   **Data Layer:** Thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p Room Database v\341\273\233i c\303\241c Entity (`TargetPoint`, `RoiRegion`, `MacroEntity`, `ScriptEntity`) v\303\240 DAO t\306\260\306\241ng \341\273\251ng.\n*   **Repository:** T\341\272\241o `AppRepository` \304\221\341\273\203 qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u v\303\240 `LogRepository` \304\221\341\273\203 ghi nh\341\272\255t k\303\275 ho\341\272\241t \304\221\341\273\231ng.\n*   **Services:**\n    *   `SmartAccessibilityService`: \304\220\303\243 tri\341\273\203n khai c\303\241c h\303\240m `click`, `doubleClick`, `longPress`, `swipe`, `pasteText`.\n    *   `ScreenCaptureService`: \304\220\303\243 tri\341\273\203n khai Foreground Service \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\273\245p m\303\240n h\303\254nh s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng `MediaProjection`.\n*   **Scripts:** \304\220\303\243 t\341\272\241o `SampleScripts.kt` v\341\273\233i 5 k\341\273\213ch b\341\272\243n m\341\272\253u (Skip n\303\272t, D\303\241n & G\341\273\255i, V\303\262ng l\341\272\267p, X\341\273\255 l\303\275 Popup, Retry).\n*   **Assets:** C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh icon \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng v\341\273\233i gradient hi\341\273\207n \304\221\341\272\241i v\303\240 vector target.\n\n### 4. Model Knowledge\n*   **Architecture:** S\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng Repository Pattern \304\221\341\273\203 t\303\241ch bi\341\273\207t Data Layer. D\341\273\213ch v\341\273\245 ch\341\273\245p m\303\240n h\303\254nh s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng `MediaProjection` y\303\252u c\341\272\247u `FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PROJECTION`.\n*   **Concurrency:** C\303\241c thao t\303\241c Accessibility \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n qua `suspend` functions \304\221\341\273\203 tr\303\241nh block Main Thread.\n*   **Dependencies:** \304\220\303\243 t\303\255ch h\341\273\243p th\303\240nh c\303\264ng `mlkit-text-recognition`, `rhino` (JavaScript engine), v\303\240 `gson` (JSON serialization).\n*   **Constraints:** `ScreenCaptureService` c\341\272\247n `MediaProjection` permission t\341\273\253 ng\306\260\341\273\235i d\303\271ng tr\306\260\341\273\233c khi kh\341\273\237i t\341\272\241o `VirtualDisplay`.\n\n### 5. Files and Code\n*   **Edited/Created Files:**\n    *   `/metadata.json`, `/settings.gradle.kts`, `/app/build.gradle.kts`, `/gradle/libs.versions.toml`: C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh d\341\273\261 \303\241n.\n    *   `/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`: Khai b\303\241o quy\341\273\201n v\303\240 services.\n    *   `/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml`: C\303\241c chu\341\273\227i t\303\240i nguy\303\252n.\n    *   `/app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml` & `ic_launcher_foreground.xml`: Icon \341\273\251ng d\341\273\245ng.\n    *   `/app/src/main/res/xml/accessibility_service_config.xml`: C\341\272\245u h\303\254nh Accessibility.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/model/Models.kt`: Data models.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/database/Daos.kt`: Room DAOs.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/database/AppDatabase.kt`: Room Database setup.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/database/AppRepository.kt`: Repository layer.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/engine/LogRepository.kt`: Logging.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/engine/SampleScripts.kt`: Script m\341\272\253u.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/service/SmartAccessibilityService.kt`: X\341\273\255 l\303\275 c\341\273\255 ch\341\273\211.\n    *   `/app/src/main/java/com/example/service/ScreenCaptureService.kt`: Ch\341\273\245p m\303\240n h\303\254nh.\n\n### 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n*   **Current Work:** \304\220\303\243 ho\303\240n th\303\240nh ph\341\272\247n n\341\273\201n t\341\272\243ng (Data, Services, Dependencies).\n*   **Next Steps:**\n    1.  T\341\272\241o UI v\341\273\233i Jetpack Compose (MainActivity, m\303\240n h\303\254nh ch\303\255nh, m\303\240n h\303\254nh qu\341\272\243n l\303\275 script/macro).\n    2.  Tri\341\273\203n khai `OverlayService` \304\221\341\273\203 hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 n\303\272t \304\221i\341\273\201u khi\341\273\203n n\341\273\225i.\n    3.  T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p Rhino v\303\240o `ExecutionManager` \304\221\341\273\203 ch\341\272\241y script.\n    4.  T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p ML Kit v\303\240o `ScreenCaptureService` \304\221\341\273\203 th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n OCR.\n*   **Skills/Rules:** \304\220\303\243 tham kh\341\272\243o `room_database_integration` (\304\221\341\273\203 thi\341\272\277t l\341\272\255p Room) v\303\240 `app_icon_generation` (\304\221\341\273\203 t\341\272\241o icon). C\303\241c file n\303\240y c\341\272\247n \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c tham chi\341\272\277u l\341\272\241i n\341\272\277u c\341\272\247n thay \304\221\341\273\225i c\341\272\245u tr\303\272c d\341\273\257 li\341\273\207u ho\341\272\267c icon."
